# here, one group at a time and all together, over the human_test recording
# run to the game's OWN exit -- per-tick digest EQUAL vs replays/human_test.digest,
# the score 2386 / floor 100 witness, log.txt reaching `Done...`, and the
# game-saved last_game.itr / MissingNO.itp / MissingNO_stats.txt / tower.cfg
